# ...except the one the plugin package ships. These entries exist because
# xtctx writes MCP config into whatever project it is set up in, including
# this one; `plugin/.mcp.json` is the opposite, a source file that Claude Code
# and Copilot CLI read out of the installed plugin. Without this it was
# silently left untracked and the published plugin registered no server on
# two of six clients.
!plugin/.mcp.json
